Package: scientometricsInR
Title: Functions and Teaching Data for the Book 'Scientometrics in R'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Raban", "Heller", , "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Helper functions and synthetic teaching datasets that
    accompany the book 'Scientometrics in R: Bibliometrics, Network
    Science, and Research Evaluation'
    <https://cttir.github.io/scientometrics-in-r/>. The functions retrieve
    and cache records from the 'OpenAlex' scholarly metadata service
    <https://openalex.org> through 'openalexR', remove duplicate records
    by DOI, compute the h-index (Hirsch 2005)
    <doi:10.1073/pnas.0507655102> and field-normalised citation scores,
    build co-authorship networks with 'igraph', rank keyword phrases with
    Rapid Automatic Keyword Extraction (Rose et al. 2010)
    <doi:10.1002/9780470689646.ch1>, and detect keyword bursts with
    Kleinberg's algorithm (Kleinberg 2003)
    <doi:10.1023/A:1024940629314>. A colour palette and a 'ggplot2' theme
    reproduce the book's figure style.
